MCELOG - CPU platform support check
-----------------------------------

The test require the Kernel to be compiled with the following config's

for MCELOG test:

CONFIG_X86_MCE
CONFIG_X86_MCELOG_LEGACY
CONFIG_X86_MCE_INJECT

Test Script for MCELOG:
mcelog_model_support_check.c

Some distributions for client platform does not contain mcelog tool in their
releases, also client parts can not support BIOS options for error injection.
According to it the test require following tools to be installed on tested
system for MCELOG test:

mcelog
mce-inject
